  "goodToKnow": "Der Einwanderer (die Einwanderin) is an immigrant: Einwanderer aus Polen, aus Syrien. The opposite is der Auswanderer (emigrant); millions of Germans emigrated to America in the 19th century. For decades, German politicians insisted Deutschland ist kein Einwanderungsland, but that view has changed, and the 2020 Skilled Immigration Act (Fachkräfteeinwanderungsgesetz) aims to attract workers. Related: der Migrant, der Zuwanderer."
